  "description": "writeSemanticBoard locates the target, takes the board-wide lease under the writer's claim or an identity minted for the write, runs Check a candidate on the board it reads under that lease, and persists the candidate once, at the next version. writeSemanticBoardAt stamps the write at an instant a caller states, which is how a prepared candidate lands as the board that was prepared.",
